War on the Sea Mod - Change Log
================================

Built for War on the Sea v1.09a.
Changes are made in Assembly-CSharp.dll (dnSpy) and in the game's text files (Override folder).

The mod is in alpha, so every version is 0.x. Version numbers group the work in the order it was built, and each follow-on part of a feature area gets a point number (v0.17.1, v0.17.2 and so on). Earlier test builds called v0.10 to v0.19 "v1.0" to "v1.9" (for example v1.8.4 is now v0.18.4).


