v0.18.4 - Crews: rescue missions on the campaign map (tested)
-------------------------------------------------------------
* Survivors left behind after a battle stay on the campaign map as a marker for 24 hours instead of being lost (orange for yours, red for the enemy's).
* Random events: every 3 to 7 days (random each time), a ship is reported sunk somewhere at sea, with its survivors marked on the map.
