v0.18.3 - Crews: rescue survivors in battle (tested)
----------------------------------------------------
* Survivors in the water: sinking ships leave survivors where they went down (60% of the men aboard, 25% after a magazine explosion, 90% when scuttled), announced in the message log (DamageableSea.SinkShip, ModCrew.OnShipSunk).
