v0.18.2 - Crews: short-crew effects (tested)
--------------------------------------------
* Short crews work slower: below 90% crew a ship loses efficiency (-30% at half crew), so reloads and damage control take longer (Utilities.SetSeaEfficiency).
* Fewer damage control parties: parties scale with the crew left, with a minimum of 1 (DamageControlInterface.SelectCell, UpdateDamageControlPartiesLeft, DamageableSea.CheckAutoDamageControl).
* Both effects update live as men are lost in battle, and apply to enemy ships too.
