v0.18 - Crews: veterancy only from real fights (tested)
-------------------------------------------------------
* No more free veterancy: a task force only gains veterancy if an enemy ship or aircraft was in the battle and at least one enemy was sunk or shot down. Before, ending any battle gave every surviving ship a battle of experience, even with no enemy there (MobileMapObject.AwardVeterancy).
