v0.17.12 - Campaign clock fix (tested)
--------------------------------------
* Daily refreshes happen at 12:00 again: supplies, command points, repairs and the other daily, hourly and weekly campaign updates used their own counters, which ran fast at slow time speeds (about 28 minutes a day at x1), so the refresh came earlier every day while the day counter stayed at 12:00. They now follow the campaign clock, and existing saves are put right when loaded (ModClock, CampaignManager.FixedUpdate).
