------------------------------------------------
* Torpedoes no longer fail to do damage: in the vanilla game, a torpedo whose first compartment hit was a deck or superstructure compartment crashed the break-back check (IndexOutOfRangeException in DamageableSea.ApplyDamage), and the torpedo did no damage at all. It now skips the break-back roll in that case and does its normal damage.


