---------------------------------------
* Enemy subs no longer spawn right next to your fleet: when the chosen ambush spot was land, shallow water or past the edge of the battle area, the sub wasn't moved and stayed about 1-1.5 km from your ships. Now it tries the other side and then closer spots until it finds open water (EngagementData.PutSubsIntoPosition).
* Enemy subs now wait 5-8 km ahead and 1-2.5 km to the side, so your fleet passes within their 2.5 km ambush trigger (config.txt enemySubAmbushOffset [5000,8000,1000,2500], was [10000,16000,4000,8000]).
